					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Fun fact: All three females in this MTF are, in fact, lesbians.<br /> Because screw likelihood. And because Moose asked from their perch high above us all if I would make everyone a lesbian and it just kinda. All the dudes were in the original character draft as well and then just the girls and then it. Ended up happening. SO.<br /> Yep. Not only is the leader of the team married to another girl, <em>the other two also like girls</em>. (Technically, Aries is pan-I-mean-hemo-sexual, but I think she counts.)</p> 
				 	]]>
