					<![CDATA[
						 <p>My character is best character, and Silber's line here just double-proves it. : P<br /> All of these people are prisoners that were caught by the Foundation, had skills that could be used out of the usual &quot;take and bake&quot; procedure, and so were moved to the team. They are&#8230; &quot;encouraged&quot; to do as they are told due to the collars around their necks. I found it suitably ironic that our greedy MCD friend has a rosary hanging around his.<br /> There are other entries. There should be arrows going to the links, so feel free to read through them all!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
